  Cell["Details", "NotesSection"],
  Cell[TextData[{"An x-factor is the three-point massless-vector building \
block carried in older constructive expressions. This routine combines the \
supported formulas using the external momenta and channel information you \
supply."}], "Notes"], Cell[TextData[{"Its defaults are Momenta->{1,2,3,4}, \
ChannelMomenta->{1,4}, and ChannelMass->Mchannel. These describe a particular \
four-point channel. They must be changed when that is not the channel in your \
expression."}], "Notes"], Cell[TextData[{"This is a specialized four-point \
routine, not a general expansion of every possible multi-particle x-factor. \
