      BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData ->
       "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/PrepareAmplitudes"],
     " handles reference choices in the context of the actual process."}],
   "Notes"], Cell[TextData[{"When comparing two completed amplitudes, do not \
use a channel-specific x-factor reduction as an unrestricted off-shell \
identity. Keep its chosen channel assumptions with the calculation."}],
   "Notes"], Cell["Options", "NotesSection"],
  Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{{Cell["Option", "TableHeader"],
